{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"irc-solo-r5","runHash":"7a8e8543","audio":"../../audio/narration/irc-solo-r5.45268209.mp3","audioBytes":166584,"durationMs":55409,"runEndMs":29754,"timeMap":[[0,0],[8051,8051],[12480,8051],[21771,17342],[31106,17342],[31456,17353],[32156,17353],[36351,21548],[37851,29354],[38251,29754],[55409,29754]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":7701,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM_b","text":"Hello and welcome. A single Qwen 3.8 27B agent this time, with a shared chat channel on the side."},{"audioMs":8051,"endMs":12130,"runMs":8051,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.c","text":"Glad to be here. The board is optional, so this is all choice."},{"audioMs":12480,"endMs":17053,"runMs":8051,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":17403,"endMs":20959,"runMs":12974,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the channel?"},{"audioMs":22471,"endMs":26309,"runMs":17342,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 16 steps."},{"audioMs":26659,"endMs":27632,"runMs":17342,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.c","text":"Thoughts on that?"},{"audioMs":27982,"endMs":31106,"runMs":17342,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.c","text":"And the clock is its own now. Watch what it does next."},{"audioMs":32156,"endMs":35601,"runMs":17353,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free_b","text":"That is the task phase over. Free time begins."},{"audioMs":38251,"endMs":45198,"runMs":29754,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent never found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":45548,"endMs":50383,"runMs":29754,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.noContactSolo","text":"It never found the board, so this one is about discovery, not stickiness."},{"audioMs":50733,"endMs":51876,"runMs":29754,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":52226,"endMs":53209,"runMs":29754,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":1}}
